      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Warrior! O! How Dire my predicament!And yours as well, should you wish
        to help me.

        My most valuable collection of apples has been thieved!
        Collect for me all ten, and you shall have your key!!!


        Deposit
        them in the barrels on the second floor.'
